	<key>This deletes every slot value, the journal of edits, the context documents, the translation memory and the saved run positions — the app-side session, for every project at once.

It stays: the project list, and every .xcstrings file. A catalog keeps the strings and the translations already written into it.

What a re-scan cannot rebuild: the context documents and the translation memory are what the app LEARNED from your corrections, and this deletes them. Edits a window is still holding — anything not yet written to a file — go with the session.

Open catalogs re-read their files afterwards and read as untranslated work. The rows go in ONE pass, so even a large store is emptied in a second or two.</key>
	<string>Hii hufuta kila thamani ya slot, jarida la mabadiliko, hati za muktadha, kumbukumbu ya tafsiri na nafasi za uendeshaji zilizohifadhiwa — kipindi cha upande wa programu, kwa miradi yote kwa pamoja.

Hubaki: orodha ya miradi, na kila faili la .xcstrings. Katalogi huhifadhi nyuzi na tafsiri tayari zilizoandikwa ndani yake.

Kile skani upya haiwezi kujenga upya: hati za muktadha na kumbukumbu ya tafsiri ndicho programu ALICHOJIFUNZA kutoka kwenye masahihisho yako, na hii huvifuta. Mabadiliko ambayo dirisha bado linashikilia — chochote ambacho bado hakijaandikwa kwenye faili — huenda na kipindi.

Katalogi zilizo wazi husoma upya faili zake baadaye na kusomeka kama kazi isiyotafsiriwa. Safu huenda kwa MKUPUO MMOJA, kwa hivyo hata hifadhi kubwa hutolewa katika sekunde moja au mbili.</string>
